  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFID&#x2019;s contribution to the World Bank Trust Fund for the implementation of the third phase of Rwanda&#x2019;s Investment Climate Reform Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity DFID&#x2019;s contribution to the World Bank Trust Fund for the implementation of the third phase of Rwanda&#x2019;s Investment Climate Reform Programme is a component of Rwanda Investment Climate Reform Programme Phase III (RICRP3) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;4,735,000. It works in the following sector(s): Trade facilitation, Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Trade policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
